WEBVTT

00:00:03.241 --> 00:00:06.900
The call needs an inbound subject to get outcomes.

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.578
Open an inbound subject's settings.

00:00:09.578 --> 00:00:16.308
Direction is Inbound, Interaction type is Automated, Channel is Phone, and Address is the number.

00:00:16.308 --> 00:00:19.901
A call is matched to its subject by that address.

00:00:20.378 --> 00:00:21.200
The A.I.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.492
configuration card holds the A.I.

00:00:23.492 --> 00:00:26.842
profile, the Subject goal, and the speech settings.

00:00:26.842 --> 00:00:32.425
The profile list shows only profiles with Start the conversation automatically turned on.

00:00:32.425 --> 00:00:36.598
The goal tells the agent when to disposition the call and end it.

00:00:37.121 --> 00:00:41.984
Live agent handoff lets the agent transfer to a person, into the Handoff

00:00:41.984 --> 00:00:45.039
queue you choose, for the reasons you tick.

00:00:45.039 --> 00:00:49.341
Without a subject, the call has no dispositions and no handoff.

